        <mxCell id="toknote1" value="1 · User token (LIVE): iss=local.ping-devops.com:9031, sub=demouser, aud=enduser.ping.demo, alg RS256" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fcefc7;strokeColor=#b8a66a;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="480" width="220" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="toknote2" value="2 · Agent token (LIVE): client_credentials, client_id=0b412e8b-cfbc-4c7d-a773-0d46118de09d, aud=enduser.ping.demo, scope=agent:invoke" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fcefc7;strokeColor=#b8a66a;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="250" y="480" width="220" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="toknote3" value="3 · TX token (LIVE): RFC 8693 — sub=demouser, act.sub=f4dd707d-…, aud=api.ping.demo:3036/mcp, scope narrowed 7 → 2 (gateway:mcp:invoke read)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fcefc7;strokeColor=#b8a66a;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="480" y="480" width="280" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="toknote45" value="4/5 · MCP tokens (LIVE): aud api.ping.demo:3036/mcp — Gateway introspection valid before tools/call; per-aud tokens for each downstream (API key via vault)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fcefc7;strokeColor=#b8a66a;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="770" y="480" width="400" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="live_exchange" value="TOKEN EXCHANGES OBSERVED LIVE (real run, PingFederate issuer)&#10;&#10;Exchange 1 — user token + agent token → TX token (RFC 8693):&#10;  subject_token = user AT (sub=demouser, 7 scopes)&#10;  actor_token   = agent AT (client_credentials, client 0b412e8b-…)&#10;  → TX token: sub=demouser · act.sub=f4dd707d-… (the agent)&#10;              aud=api.ping.demo:3036/mcp · scope narrowed 7 → 2&#10;&#10;Exchange 2 — A2A depth-2 (sensitive tool):&#10;  agent → intermediate agent (aud=a2a-intermediate-finaid, scope=agent:invoke:finaid, act +agent)&#10;  intermediate → specialist agent (aud=api.ping.demo:3036/mcp, scope=gateway:mcp:invoke,finaid:read, act depth 2)&#10;&#10;Enforcement observed: Authorize engine=pingone · Gateway introspection valid · HITL: step-up in flight, Gateway authorize INDETERMINATE&#10;Intent token (BFF-minted, not the AS): intent, tools-allowed list, prompt_hash" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbf3c0;strokeColor=#b8ac60;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="610" width="360" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- ===== Original page token boxes (yellow, restored) ===== -->
        <mxCell id="orig_txtok" value="TX Token — VALIDATED LIVE (from a real run of this demo):&#10;&#10;{&#10;  &quot;iss&quot;: &quot;https://local.ping-devops.com:9031&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sub&quot;: &quot;demouser&quot;,&#10;  &quot;aud&quot;: &quot;https://api.ping.demo:3036/mcp&quot;,&#10;  &quot;client_id&quot;: &quot;0b412e8b-cfbc-4c7d-a773-0d46118de09d&quot;,&#10;  &quot;act&quot;: { &quot;sub&quot;: &quot;f4dd707d-f78d-4417-ba56-dc8707d10a1f&quot; },&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;gateway:mcp:invoke read&quot;  (narrowed 7 → 2),&#10;  &quot;alg&quot;: &quot;RS256&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;Observed pipeline: tools/list 401 → tools permitted 243 →&#10;agent token → RFC 8693 exchange (scope 7 → 2) →&#10;tools/call 401 → Gateway introspection valid → tool result.&#10;&#10;Original teaching example kept below:&#10;{&#10;  &quot;client_id&quot;: &quot;a98e8bec-…&quot;,&#10;  &quot;iss&quot;: &quot;https://auth.pingone.com/3f720e3e-…/as&quot;,&#10;  &quot;aud&quot;: [&quot;http://MCPServer1:3100&quot;],&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;mcp:travel_tools&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sub&quot;: &quot;9eb6be12-…&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sid&quot;: &quot;c98f54d8-…&quot;,&#10;  &quot;auth_time&quot;: 1776864815,&#10;  &quot;acr&quot;: &quot;af0a5f9d…&quot;,&#10;  &quot;act&quot;: { &quot;sub&quot;: &quot;a98e8bec-…&quot; },&#10;  &quot;env&quot;: &quot;…&quot;, &quot;org&quot;: &quot;…&quot;, &quot;p1.userId&quot;: &quot;…&quot;&#10;}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbf3c0;strokeColor=#b8ac60;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="150" width="150" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="orig_flow" value="Person authenticates to WebApp — App token returned to App&#10;Person opens the Chat UX — silent request for Person (Agent) token&#10;Person (Agent) token passed to Agent&#10;Agent authenticates to its client_id&#10;Prompt instructs Agent to leverage an MCP Server tool — wrong token = 400/401 (observed live: tools/list 401, tools/call 401)&#10;Agent performs a token exchange to get the MCP Server Token (TX Token)&#10;Token passed to MCP Server and validated (aud)&#10;Tool executes and response returned to Agent" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbf3c0;strokeColor=#b8ac60;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="520" width="440" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="orig_rules" value="Agent MUST have a Person token&#10;MCP Tools MUST have MCP Server token&#10;&#10;Incoming token has proper scope and aud for the MCP Tools — this Agent is explicit in the act claim" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbf3c0;strokeColor=#b8ac60;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="480" y="520" width="280" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="orig_why" value="Why Token Exchange?&#10;&#10;Mitigated Risks:&#10;• Person token used by Agent directly to the API Server&#10;• Person token exfiltrated and sent directly to the MCP Server&#10;• Person token injected into a rogue Agent connected to the MCP Server&#10;• Agent token exfiltrated and sent to MCP Server&#10;&#10;Complexity:&#10;• App needs a separate Person (Agent) token — can be done with prompt=none&#10;• Agent needs to retrieve its own token (separate Client)&#10;• Agent needs to perform OAuth Token Exchange&#10;• Agent manages multiple tokens — one for each MCP Server (aud). Potentially solved with RFC 8707&#10;• Where does this exchange happen? 1 ClientID for all MCP Servers, or 1 per MCP Server?&#10;• Token Exchange MUST require Subject &amp;&amp; Actor tokens" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbf3c0;strokeColor=#b8ac60;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="780" y="520" width="420" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="orig_appconfig" value="App Config&#10;MCP Server(s): ClientID&#10;App performs Token Management?&#10;How does App know which token to pass to Agent?" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbf3c0;strokeColor=#b8ac60;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1220" y="520" width="200" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="orig_agentconfig" value="Agent Config&#10;MCP Server(s): URL" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbf3c0;strokeColor=#b8ac60;fontColor=#1a1a1a;fontSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1440" y="520" width="140" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
